        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "The area multiplies by $9$.",
          "worked": "The original area is $A=\\pi r^{2}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}A_{\\text{new}}&=\\pi(3r)^{2}\\\\A_{\\text{new}}&=9\\pi r^{2}\\\\A_{\\text{new}}&=9A\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe area multiplies by $9$.",
